    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Target companies for direct ATS pulls, grouped by the platform they run on.\n// WHY THESE: explicit >=35 LPA fresher pay in India is rare to find written in a JD,\n// so instead of keyword-hunting we target employers KNOWN to pay in that band for\n// freshers and pull their FULL board every run, rather than guessing at search keywords.\n//\n// CHECKED (2026-08-27) - confirmed live on Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby:\n//   Razorpay -> greenhouse -> razorpaysoftwareprivatelimited\n//\n// CHECKED - NOT found on Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby, so left OUT rather than guessed:\n//   DE Shaw, Optiver, Tower Research Capital, Graviton Research Capital,\n//   Hudson River Trading, Jump Trading (quant/HFT firms mostly run their own\n//   custom careers sites, e.g. deshaw.com, optiver.com - not a public ATS API)\n//   Rubrik, Sprinklr, Media.net, CRED, Groww (postings for these only surface via\n//   aggregators like BuiltIn/Naukri, which usually means Workday, Darwinbox, or a\n//   custom system behind them, not Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby)\n// If you confirm a real token for any of these later, add it below the same way.\n//\n// IMPORTANT: board tokens are set independently by each company and DO change.\n// Verify any NEW addition before relying on it:\n//   Greenhouse -> visit https://boards.greenhouse.io/<token>\n//   Lever      -> visit https://jobs.lever.co/<token>\n//   Ashby      -> visit https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/<token>\n\nconst companies = [\n  // --- Verified in the original workflow ---\n  { platform: 'greenhouse', token: 'stripe' },\n  { platform: 'lever', token: 'netflix' },\n  { platform: 'ashby', token: 'openai' },\n\n  // --- Verified 2026-08-27: high-paying Indian unicorn on Greenhouse ---\n  { platform: 'greenhouse', token: 'razorpaysoftwareprivatelimited', note: 'Razorpay' },\n];\n\nfunction buildUrl(c) {\n  if (c.platform === 'greenhouse') return `https://boards-api.greenhouse.io/v1/boards/${c.token}/jobs?content=true`;\n  if (c.platform === 'lever') return `https://api.lever.co/v0/postings/${c.token}?mode=json`;\n  if (c.platform === 'ashby') return `https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/${c.token}`;\n  return null;\n}\n\nreturn companies\n  .filter(c => c.token && c.token !== '<<ADD_TOKEN>>')\n  .map(c => ({ json: { ...c, url: buildUrl(c) } }));\n"
      },
