              "content": "=Evaluate this job description for a FRESHER / entry-level (0-1 yr experience) Data Science, AI/ML, or Software Engineering candidate based in India or open to remote.\n\nEstimate total compensation for this role AT THIS COMPANY for a fresher hire in INR LPA. If the JD does not state a number, estimate it from what you know about this company's typical fresher/new-grad pay band in India (e.g. quant trading firms and top-tier product companies routinely pay 30-80+ LPA to freshers; typical services/mid-tier product companies pay far less) rather than defaulting to a generic guess. Say so via the 'salary_source' field.\n\nOnly set meets_criteria=true if: role is Data Science/AI/ML/Software Engineering, experience level is fresher/entry-level (not senior/staff/principal), location is India or remote, AND estimated compensation is >= 30 LPA.\n\nReturn ONLY JSON: {\"score\": 85, \"salary_inr_lpa\": 45, \"salary_source\": \"stated_in_jd | company_tier_estimate\", \"meets_criteria\": true, \"key_skills\": [\"Python\",\"Distributed Systems\"]}\n\nJob: {{ $json.title }} at {{ $json.company }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nDescription: {{ $json.description }}"
